{"page":233,"w":7029,"h":11508,"lines":[{"x":0.2019002411031004,"text":"To crush under foot","conf":1,"y":0.95058139594997071,"w":0.27790973712871603,"h":0.01744185932098874},{"x":0.2013161037278732,"w":0.40038054330008366,"y":0.9198472874046002,"h":0.027751951936691555,"text":"all the prisoners of the earth,","conf":1},{"y":0.90104166663919794,"text":"to turn aside the right of a man","x":0.19952495726717578,"w":0.4346793038504464,"conf":1,"h":0.020585317460317443},{"w":0.46645107516994722,"text":"in the presence of the Most High,","y":0.87633748824253965,"x":0.19906562520408888,"h":0.025212829075162424,"conf":1},{"h":0.026743861417921733,"text":"to subvert a man in his cause,","conf":1,"x":0.2013170553675443,"y":0.85440033170421348,"w":0.41458927501331677},{"conf":1,"x":0.20082979801842421,"w":0.37741727952833298,"h":0.030295782619052414,"text":"the Lord does not approve.","y":0.82846719193134488},{"w":0.60480236697506595,"conf":1,"text":"\"Who has commanded and it came to pass,","h":0.02963921001979275,"x":0.18219059036999039,"y":0.79916276437981171},{"text":"unless the Lord has ordained it?","conf":1,"x":0.201688580736155,"y":0.7818961843748643,"h":0.020509418987092576,"w":0.44230770755123783},{"x":0.19912791500247123,"w":0.58286186317344768,"h":0.027711851256234432,"conf":1,"text":"Is it not from the mouth of the Most High","y":0.7554416434788791},{"x":0.19952493647310238,"conf":1,"y":0.73536706316450329,"text":"that good and evil come?\" (3: 27-38.)","w":0.52256532148881396,"h":0.020446889930301304},{"text":"Let us then receive in patience, as from God's hand, what","w":0.81511371166675117,"h":0.025099807315402622,"conf":1,"y":0.70140367426853112,"x":0.090046559525493883},{"h":0.020446889930301193,"y":0.68168604686366718,"conf":1,"text":"He sends us, and address our hopes to the world of unseen","w":0.81235152405577826,"x":0.087885987568310578},{"h":0.027721713459680997,"y":0.6552911234732659,"x":0.087593811361490539,"w":0.81530395111480314,"conf":1,"text":"realities. It is just in so doing that we shall win true inner"},{"w":0.81501447999632204,"conf":1,"text":"freedom for the urgent tasks of the present, courage to","h":0.023893856813037351,"y":0.63459016669429902,"x":0.087714748924372463},{"text":"accomplish the work which in the distress of our days is laid","y":0.61334325393391809,"h":0.02037767569224036,"w":0.81472684191418931,"conf":1,"x":0.087885992730553586},{"conf":1,"text":"upon us. For then no disillusionment can paralyse our","y":0.59002976193143009,"w":0.81472684191418931,"h":0.023342331250508774,"x":0.087885986020340062},{"conf":1,"x":0.087886007687311432,"y":0.56686046521922395,"w":0.81710211023107737,"h":0.023255813689458948,"text":"strength; then we have become unassailable. Patience which,"},{"h":0.020452657389262496,"conf":1,"w":0.81472684191418931,"text":"abandoning earthly hopes, nevertheless continues to hope,","x":0.087885991038154671,"y":0.54651162825901589},{"y":0.52325581425002121,"w":0.81472684191418931,"h":0.021883074253324475,"text":"bears within itself the seeds of fulfilment. The way into the","conf":1,"x":0.087885995402762526},{"h":0.020371908233279168,"w":0.81710211023107759,"y":0.50145348882795293,"text":"darkness of death is already lightened by the dawn of","x":0.087886005352733942,"conf":1},{"text":"resurrection life. If we decide for God, we shall become","conf":1,"x":0.087731382034622524,"y":0.47722591036656847,"w":0.81267042283887991,"h":0.024708865180848139},{"x":0.085412035052111909,"conf":1,"w":0.8148991473309406,"text":"inwardly aware that God has already decided for us. Then","y":0.45580859945652763,"h":0.022411630267188731},{"x":0.087885991831968394,"y":0.43452380953230918,"conf":1,"w":0.81235152405577815,"text":"we shall not only \"rejoice in our hope of sharing the glory","h":0.021871539335402201},{"x":0.085510680159295027,"h":0.023255813689458948,"y":0.41133720934713103,"text":"of God\", but, \"more than that, we rejoice in our sufferings,","conf":1,"w":0.81472684191418931},{"conf":1,"text":"knowing that suffering produces endurance, and endurance","x":0.087886001494336854,"y":0.38953488413526172,"h":0.020435354066273614,"w":0.81235152405577804},{"w":0.81235152405577804,"conf":1,"x":0.087886001494336854,"y":0.36627907020253758,"h":0.02037767569224036,"text":"produces character, and character produces hope, and hope"},{"conf":1,"y":0.34300595268757006,"h":0.021825396825396859,"w":0.80997625573889009,"x":0.08788597633186139,"text":"does not disappoint us, because God's love has been poured"},{"text":"into our hearts through the Holy Spirit which has been","x":0.083135395478285773,"y":0.3226686505152867,"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.020354604910290397,"conf":1},{"text":"given to us\" (Rom. 5: 3-5).","w":0.38479809946828081,"y":0.29935515833211335,"conf":1,"h":0.02186577187644112,"x":0.085510685467759945},{"conf":1,"text":"In order that this experience may truly be ours, let us","y":0.27390613387006335,"h":0.034012204124813983,"w":0.78222636433390813,"x":0.11842226538933229},{"conf":1,"x":0.085367035682004613,"w":0.49903825041535604,"y":0.25722451825758585,"h":0.020792503205556701,"text":"now heed the final words of our text:"},{"conf":1,"h":0.026053807092091374,"y":0.22220084775613513,"w":0.49052701677594868,"x":0.24168918856130991,"text":"\"Let us test and examine our ways,"},{"w":0.33016625936929284,"conf":1,"x":0.25890736500062678,"y":0.20486111091792358,"h":0.016121031746031744,"text":"and return to the Lord!"},{"text":"Let us lift up our hearts and hands","conf":1,"w":0.47743467851118604,"y":0.17877906991599268,"x":0.26128265943799367,"h":0.020377675692240471},{"text":"to God in heaven!\"","conf":1,"w":0.27315912618265525,"x":0.25653207898111885,"y":0.15988372162847586,"h":0.018935722964150581},{"y":0.088662790968260352,"conf":1,"text":"237","x":0.46555819426305822,"w":0.049881235345617503,"h":0.014534883082859107}]}